📊📊 📊 Insurance Claims Analysis using SQL

📌📌 📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing an insurance claims dataset using SQL. The main objective is to practice and demonstrate subquery concepts including scalar subqueries and correlated subqueries in a real world scenario.

The dataset contains details about policy holders, claim types, claim amounts, dates, and approval status.

---

 🎯🎯🎯 Objectives

* Analyze claim data using SQL queries
* Understand and apply subqueries
* Perform filtering based on business conditions
* Compare individual records with aggregated values
* Prepare queries suitable for interview scenarios

---

 🛠️🛠️🛠️ Tools Used

* SQL
* MySQL or PostgreSQL
* Any SQL editor like DBeaver or SSMS

