📂📂 🗂️ Dataset Description

Table Name: `claims`

| Column Name   | Description                       |
| ------------- | --------------------------------- |
| claim_id      | Unique claim identifier           |
| policy_holder | Name of the policy holder         |
| policy_type   | Type of insurance                 |
| claim_amount  | Amount claimed                    |
| claim_date    | Date of claim                     |
| status        | Claim status Approved or Rejected |

---

📈📈 📥 Table Creation

```sql
CREATE TABLE claims (
claim_id INT,
policy_holder VARCHAR(50),
policy_type VARCHAR(50),
claim_amount INT,
claim_date DATE,
status VARCHAR(20)
);
```

