## 📊 SQL Analysis Tasks

💹 ✅ Task 1

Find claims where claim amount is greater than average claim amount

```sql
SELECT *
FROM claims
WHERE claim_amount > (
    SELECT AVG(claim_amount)
    FROM claims
);
```

---

🌼🌼 ✅ Task 2

Find policy holders who have at least one approved claim

```sql
SELECT DISTINCT policy_holder
FROM claims
WHERE status = 'Approved';
```

---

🎯🎯 ✅ Task 3

Find claims where claim amount is greater than that policy holder average claim

```sql
SELECT *
FROM claims c1
WHERE claim_amount > (
    SELECT AVG(claim_amount)
    FROM claims c2
    WHERE c1.policy_holder = c2.policy_holder
);
```

---

☸️☸️☸️✅ Task 4

Display each claim along with overall average claim amount

```sql
SELECT *,
       (SELECT AVG(claim_amount) FROM claims) AS overall_avg
FROM claims;
```

